$MDESC::Type = "GoldenEye007";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other inside a Chemical Warfare Facility in Arkangelsk. " @
         "\n\n<f1>OHMSS Briefing: " @
         "\n\n<f0>Grabbed by the Spetznaz James? Sounds painful." @
         "\n\n<f0>No time for gadgets here 007. " @
         "\n\n<f0>Just be certain to knock out the heavy gun emplacements and missile battery or theyll swat you out of the air like a silly fly. " @
         "\n\n<f0>Grace under pressure as always James. " @
         "\n\n<f0>Simple. " @
         "\n\n<f2>These chemicals could prove to be a match even for your pheromones James. Dont take too many risks.";